--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Proprietary firmware
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The `fp3-firmware` package downloads proprietary Qualcomm and Fairphone
firmware blobs from https://github.com/FairBlobs/FP3-firmware at build time:
the modem (MPSS), ADSP, WCNSS Wi-Fi/Bluetooth, Venus video codec and Adreno
GPU images, the WLAN NV data, the speaker amplifier DSP firmware and the ADSP
sensor registry.

These are NOT redistributed by this repository, are not covered by the
Apache-2.0 license above, and remain the property of their respective owners.
They are required for the modem, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, GPU, audio and sensors to
function. Set BR2_PACKAGE_FP3_FIRMWARE=n to build without them.
